# 3. `launches` table

This is your **main table**.

Each row is one token launch.

```sql
CREATE TABLE launches (
    mint VARCHAR(100) PRIMARY KEY,

    name VARCHAR(255),
    symbol VARCHAR(100),

    creator_wallet VARCHAR(100),

    launch_time DATETIME NOT NULL,
    received_at DATETIME NOT NULL,

    raw_event_id BIGINT,

    name_lower VARCHAR(255),
    symbol_lower VARCHAR(100),

    launch_date DATE,
    launch_hour TINYINT,
    launch_day_of_week TINYINT,

    is_migrated BOOLEAN DEFAULT FALSE,
    migration_time DATETIME NULL,
    minutes_to_migration INT NULL,

    duplicate_name_count_at_launch INT DEFAULT 0,
    duplicate_symbol_count_at_launch INT DEFAULT 0,

    created_at TIMESTAMP DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,
    updated_at TIMESTAMP DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP ON UPDATE CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,

    FOREIGN KEY (creator_wallet) REFERENCES creators(creator_wallet),
    FOREIGN KEY (raw_event_id) REFERENCES raw_events(raw_event_id),

    INDEX idx_launches_creator_wallet (creator_wallet),
    INDEX idx_launches_launch_time (launch_time),
    INDEX idx_launches_name (name),
    INDEX idx_launches_symbol (symbol),
    INDEX idx_launches_is_migrated (is_migrated),
    INDEX idx_launches_launch_hour (launch_hour),
    INDEX idx_launches_launch_day_of_week (launch_day_of_week)
);
```

## Columns explained

| Column                             | Type           | Why you need it                              |
| ---------------------------------- | -------------- | -------------------------------------------- |
| `mint`                             | `VARCHAR(100)` | Token mint address; main token ID            |
| `name`                             | `VARCHAR(255)` | Token name                                   |
| `symbol`                           | `VARCHAR(100)` | Token ticker/symbol                          |
| `creator_wallet`                   | `VARCHAR(100)` | Wallet that created/launched token           |
| `launch_time`                      | `DATETIME`     | Actual/recorded launch time                  |
| `received_at`                      | `DATETIME`     | Time your bot received it                    |
| `raw_event_id`                     | `BIGINT`       | Links to full JSON in `raw_events`           |
| `name_lower`                       | `VARCHAR(255)` | Lowercase name for easier searching          |
| `symbol_lower`                     | `VARCHAR(100)` | Lowercase symbol for easier searching        |
| `launch_date`                      | `DATE`         | Easier daily analysis                        |
| `launch_hour`                      | `TINYINT`      | Easier hourly analysis                       |
| `launch_day_of_week`               | `TINYINT`      | Monday/Sunday pattern analysis               |
| `is_migrated`                      | `BOOLEAN`      | Whether token migrated or not                |
| `migration_time`                   | `DATETIME`     | Migration time copied here for easy analysis |
| `minutes_to_migration`             | `INT`          | How long it took to migrate                  |
| `duplicate_name_count_at_launch`   | `INT`          | How many times this name appeared before     |
| `duplicate_symbol_count_at_launch` | `INT`          | How many times this symbol appeared before   |
| `created_at`                       | `TIMESTAMP`    | Row creation time                            |
| `updated_at`                       | `TIMESTAMP`    | Last update time                             |

This table allows you to study:

```text
new launches
launch timing
creator history
name/symbol patterns
migration success
time-to-migration
duplicate themes
```

